{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280650/extras/998ac2d90b520df09276cefaafd12dbd.poster.avif?t=1760795224\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280650/extras/998ac2d90b520df09276cefaafd12dbd.webm?t=1760795224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280650/extras/998ac2d90b520df09276cefaafd12dbd.mp4?t=1760795224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paper Wars is a single-player flight action game where you pilot powerful paper airplanes. Face off against an army of red paper planes, along with land and sea threats. Unlock and upgrade your fleet to dominate the skies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Well-Armed Paper Airplanes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These paper planes aren\u2019t your regular kind! They come with guns, missiles, and more. Customize your plane with different weapons and gear to suit your style. Face off against enemies in the sky, on land, and in the sea with your upgraded paper plane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280650/extras/14ccac6169fc3ec58fa05a5c357a1b4e.poster.avif?t=1760795224\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280650/extras/14ccac6169fc3ec58fa05a5c357a1b4e.webm?t=1760795224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280650/extras/14ccac6169fc3ec58fa05a5c357a1b4e.mp4?t=1760795224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3280